# ============================================================
# hap_release_kit .gitignore
# 说明:
#   - key.pem / xiaobai.p12 包含签名私钥, 绝不入库
#   - *.hap 超过 GitHub 100MiB 文件限制, 不入库
#   - hap_installer/ 是 157MB 的二进制复制品, 不入库
# ============================================================

# --- 私钥与密钥材料 ---
certs/key.pem
certs/xiaobai.p12

# --- 大文件(超 GitHub 限制) ---
input/*.hap
output/*.hap
hap_installer/

# --- 本机工具 store(不入库) ---
store/

# --- 临时文件与系统文件 ---
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
